{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2015-12", "window": 4, "start_date": 1450915200, "end_date": 1451606399, "month_true_total": 57, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:51:37 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "20137972", "author": {"steamid": "76561197995160761", "personaname": "LnL - Chris M", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/KradenEcho/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 30, "playtime_forever": 481, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 481, "last_played": 1451535335, "avatar": "1f954359ca817ec2423bdd9840c51f98fe57336b"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's ok.\n\nThe game is fun enough, challenging enough, but lacks substance.\nThe level designs and modelling is great and it feels very unique, but many areas feel empty and so is your character development. A levelling system or challenge upgrade system would have been great, but without it the game is just \"Go to room, shoot orks till there are no more, plot progress after a few rooms\".\n\nThe combat system is fluid enough if a little too simple, most guns feel great to use and do a decent amount of damage, with others feeling like you're going through clips with little effect.\n\nIf you're looking to spend 2-3 afternoons having a fun Halo-esque gun romp in the Warhammer universe it was exactly what you're after. If you're used to a modern 3rd person combat game like darksiders or the Witcher you'll find it somewhat lacking.", "timestamp_created": 1451536217, "timestamp_updated": 1451536217, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "20134115", "author": {"steamid": "76561197976324852", "personaname": "{VOID} Shabooms", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197976324852/", "num_games_owned": 369, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 3473, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3418, "last_played": 1445572656, "avatar": "7b511c840ae3288f604ea2a30d2c0bef66a13df0"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great game. Short though.", "timestamp_created": 1451524762, "timestamp_updated": 1451524762, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "20105921", "author": {"steamid": "76561197999941755", "personaname": "rook_1369", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197999941755/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 2805, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2805, "last_played": 1445295400, "avatar": "cb0aee744eee050bbc05e34e44785152fedfcdae"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very much enjoyed this game. It feels like a port from a console because of the key bashing at some points in the game. I would not call myself a huge 40K fan, but I do enjoy the world. I thoroughly enjoyed the game, in both single and online multi-player modes.", "timestamp_created": 1451460649, "timestamp_updated": 1451460649, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "20103455", "author": {"steamid": "76561198177793886", "personaname": "M1K3L17", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/M1K3L17/", "num_games